      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A handkerchief dropped by\na regular at Café Warehouse.\nIt smells faintly like a Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "シッポウシティにある　カフェソーコの\nじょうれんが　おとした　ハンカチ。\nほのかに　ポケモンの　かおりがする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "칠보시티에 있는 카페 갤러지의\n단골손님이 떨어뜨린 손수건.\n희미하게 포켓몬의 냄새가 난다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mouchoir égaré par un habitué du Café de\nla Grange. Il sent légèrement le Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Taschentuch, das ein Stammkunde im\nCafé Lagerhaus in Septerna City verloren hat.\nRiecht leicht nach Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Al usarse en un huerto de bayas, provoca\nextrañas mutaciones según la combinación de\nlas mismas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pezzo di stoffa perso al Bar Magazzino\ndi Zefiropoli da un cliente abituale.\nOdora leggermente di Pokémon.",
